<title>NETHERLANDS: Hoogovens 1996 net profit sharply lower.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens 1996 net profit sharply lower.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch steel and aluminium group Hoogovens NV said on Thursday its 1996 net profit fell sharply to 326 million guilders from 507 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said it would pay a dividend of 3.00 guilders per share, unchanged from 1995.</p>
</text>
